{emailSubject}Solution review removed{/emailSubject}
<h1>A solution review was erased!</h1>

<p>
    The review of your solution was <strong>deleted</strong>.
    All source code issues and comments were removed along with the review.
</p>

<table role="presentation" class="facts" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
    <tr>
        <td class="k">Group</td>
        <td class="v">{$group}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="k">Assignment</td>
        <td class="v">{$assignment}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="k">Solution</td>
        <td class="v">#{$attempt}, submitted at {$submitted|localizedDate:'en'}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="k">Review closed</td>
        <td class="v">{$closed|localizedDate:'en'}</td>
    </tr>
</table>

{button($detailUrl, 'Open the solution')|noescape}
